      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Loop() - repetir indefinidamente:\n1) digitalWrite(2, HIGH)\n2) Serial.println(\"t = N s   GPIO2 = ALTO\")\n3) delay(2000)\n4) digitalWrite(2, LOW)\n5) Serial.println(\"t = N s   GPIO2 = BAJO\")\n6) delay(2000)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Loop() - repetir indefinidamente:\n1) digitalWrite(2, HIGH)\n2) Serial.println(\"t = N s   GPIO2 = ALTO\")\n3) delay(2000)\n4) digitalWrite(2, LOW)\n5) Serial.println(\"t = N s   GPIO2 = BAJO\")\n6) delay(2000)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
